1788   DB5B             ;**************************************************************************
1789   DB5B             ;* This is similar to 'addthread' below but the timer data does not follow
1790   DB5B             ;* the jsr. Instead, the timer data is pre-loaded into 'thread_timer_byte'.
1791   DB5B             ;* The thread is started in the same manner as described below.
