1872   DBC2             ;****************************************************************************
1873   DBC2             ;* This is the main routine in charge of adding new threads to the
1874   DBC2             ;* virtual machine. The following variables are passed.
1875   DBC2             ;*
1876   DBC2             ;*  A: Pushed into VMregA
1877   DBC2             ;*  B: Pushed into VMregB
1878   DBC2             ;*  X: Thread Initial Program Counter
1879   DBC2             ;*  
1880   DBC2             ;* In addition, the following two variables contain data for the
1881   DBC2             ;* thread.
1882   DBC2             ;*  thread_priority:        Unique Identifier to classify thread
1883   DBC2             ;*  system_temp_word2:  ???
1884   DBC2             ;*
1885   DBC2             ;* See header definition file for specifics on thread class structure
1886   DBC2             ;*
1887   DBC2             ;* Returns: Carry Cleared if New Thread was added
1888   DBC2             ;*          Carry Set if VM was full
1889   DBC2             ;*
