4532   E9C8             ;***********************************************
4533   E9C8             ;* This routine is spawned as a thread when the
4534   E9C8             ;* credits in memory space do not match
4535   E9C8             ;* the number of credits in the CMOS RAM. It 
4536   E9C8             ;* Takes care of bringing them equal in a timely
4537   E9C8             ;* fashion and calling the game ROM hook each
4538   E9C8             ;* time a credit is added to the memory location. 
4539   E9C8             ;* With this, the game ROM can control the credit 
4540   E9C8             ;* award process.
4541   E9C8             ;***********************************************            
4542   E9C8 CE 01 6E    creditq         ldx #aud_currentcredits     ;CMOS: Current Credits
